[E0467] Warning: `Kind` compares, hashes and clones without being told
    ╭─[ err/624_needless_derive/main.wip:13:9 ]
    │
 13 │ @derive(Clone, Eq, Hash, Text)
    │         ──┬──  ─┬  ──┬─
    │           ╰────────────── `Clone` says nothing here
    │                 │    │
    │                 ╰──────── nor does `Eq`
    │                      │
    │                      ╰─── nor does `Hash`
    │
    │ Help: remove `Clone`, `Eq` and `Hash`
    │
    │ Note 1: an enum whose variants carry nothing implements `Eq` and `Hash` by which name it is
    │
    │ Note 2: plain data owns no memory — no `own`, no `String`, no `Vec`, nothing with a `destroy` — and its clone is a copy, taken wherever `Clone` is asked for
────╯
