[E0303] Error: cannot apply `==` to `Shape`
    ╭─[ err/624_needless_derive/main.wip:49:30 ]
    │
 49 │     val same = Shape::Square == Shape::Square
    │                ──────┬────── ─┬ ──────┬──────
    │                      ╰───────────────────────── `Shape`
    │                               │       │
    │                               ╰──────────────── `==` and `!=` compare numbers or `bool`
    │                                       │
    │                                       ╰──────── `Shape`
    │
    │ Help: write `@derive(Eq)` on `Shape`, and the compiler writes the comparison field by field
    │
    │ Note: a type whose equality is not its fields writes `extend …: Eq` itself instead
